    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Quality boxes, bubble wrap, mattress covers, and wooden crates protect items during the journey. Prices vary with the volume of goods, generally falling between ₹3,000 and ₹7,500 for a standard three‑bedroom move.</p>
