    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Optional but recommended, insurance covers loss or damage. Companies usually offer coverage at 0.5 % to 1 % of the declared value. For goods valued at ₹10 lakh, the insurance premium will be roughly ₹5,000 to ₹10,000.</p>
