    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Extras such as disassembly/re‑assembly, white‑glove handling, temporary storage, or doorstep delivery can increase costs. These services are billed per hour (₹800–₹1,200) or as flat fees (₹2,000–₹6,000) depending on the complexity.</p>
