      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">7‑layer protective packaging system used by packers and movers from Mumbai to Coimbatore</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p><strong>7‑Layer Protective Packaging System</strong> is the gold standard for packers and movers operating between Mumbai and Coimbatore. By layering materials strategically, this system safeguards furniture, appliances, and fragile items against shocks, moisture, and dust during the long journey across the Western and Southern corridors of India.</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Layer 1 – Bubble Wrap</strong>: The first line of defense, bubble wrap cushions every surface, absorbing micro‑impacts and preventing scratches on glass, ceramics, and wooden frames. It’s applied directly to the item, ensuring a snug, shock‑absorbing layer.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Layer 2 – Foam Protectors</strong>: Foam inserts or custom‑cut foam sheets wrap around the bubble‑wrapped item, filling voids and locking the shape in place. This layer stabilises bulky pieces and protects against compression during stacking.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Layer 3 – Corrugated Sheets</strong>: Corrugated cardboard sheets are placed over the foam, providing a rigid barrier that resists punctures and distributes weight evenly. These sheets are cut to match the item’s dimensions, offering a tailored fit.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Layer 4 – Stretch Film</strong>: A tight roll of stretch film is wrapped around the corrugated assembly, sealing the package against dust, humidity, and accidental openings. The film also adds a slight compression that keeps the layers together during transit.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Layer 5 – Wooden Crates</strong>: For heavy or highly valuable items, a custom wooden crate is built around the wrapped package. Crates add structural integrity and enable secure stacking in the transport vehicle.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Layer 6 – Packing Tape & Sealants</strong>: High‑strength packing tape secures the stretch film, and sealants are applied to any seams or edges. This ensures the outer shell remains intact throughout the Mumbai‑to‑Coimbatore route.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Layer 7 – External Labeling & Handling Instructions</strong>: The final layer consists of clearly marked labels and handling stickers (“Fragile”, “This Side Up”, “Keep Dry”). These visual cues guide drivers and handlers, reducing mishandling and damage.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>Adopting this comprehensive 7‑layer approach guarantees that every item—whether a vintage teak chair or a delicate crystal vase—arrives in Coimbatore in the same pristine condition it left Mumbai. Packers and movers who master this system combine meticulous packing with proven materials, turning long‑distance relocation into a risk‑free, stress‑free experience for their clients.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


