      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an interstate shift from Mumbai to Coimbatore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, original invoice or purchase order for the goods, GST registration details (if applicable), a signed packing list, and a copy of the e‑Way bill generated for the shipment. For corporate moves, add the company’s PAN and authorization letter. All documents are verified before loading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging system differ from standard packing methods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system combines high‑density bubble wrap, custom foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, stretch film weather‑proofing, reinforced wooden crates, and IRDAI‑approved marine insurance coverage. Unlike basic cardboard wrapping, each layer is engineered to absorb shocks, prevent moisture ingress, and secure fragile items such as glassware, electronics, and temple idols during the long highway transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time during the Mumbai‑Coimbatore transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container truck is equipped with satellite‑linked GPS devices that feed live location data to our customer portal. Once your goods are loaded, you receive a tracking ID that lets you monitor the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint stops, giving you full visibility throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the insurance coverage provided by Shree Ashirwad sufficient for high‑value items?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers 100 % declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI, covering loss, theft, or damage up to the full market value you declare. For high‑value assets such as artwork, antiques, or premium electronics, you can opt for additional coverage tiers, ensuring complete financial protection throughout the move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are the costs calculated in the Mumbai to Coimbatore cost matrix?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost matrix is built on four core components: base freight charge (distance‑based), packing material cost (type and quantity of 7‑layer packaging), insurance premium (percentage of declared value), and ancillary fees such as fuel surcharge, tolls, and optional services like white‑glove handling. Each component is transparently itemised in the estimate.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special considerations for moving vehicles or large furniture on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Vehicle transport uses enclosed multi‑car trailers with hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings to prevent movement. Large furniture is secured on low‑loader trucks with custom wooden cradles. Both are tracked live, and we coordinate with check‑post authorities to obtain any required permits, ensuring safe passage across state borders.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
